WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:24.910
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:25.180 --> 00:29.290
[Live Forever]

3
00:30.540 --> 00:33.000
[Episode 3]

4
01:19.760 --> 01:22.760
¥800,000. Going once to Bidder No. 303.

5
01:35.390 --> 01:36.700
As long as you're safe.

6
02:09.600 --> 02:12.390
¥1,000,000. Going once to Bidder No. 250.

7
02:24.340 --> 02:27.540
People are actually fighting over such an unknown thing.

8
02:28.140 --> 02:28.740
I think

9
02:28.770 --> 02:29.770
these two people

10
02:30.120 --> 02:31.630
must have some personal grudge.

11
02:31.630 --> 02:32.680
Exactly.

12
02:32.680 --> 02:33.280
Boss.

13
02:33.420 --> 02:34.880
Boss, please be rational.

14
02:36.400 --> 02:38.710
Bidder No. 303, ¥2,000,000.

15
02:40.540 --> 02:40.860
I…

16
02:40.890 --> 02:43.450
Bidder No. 250, ¥2,500,000.

17
02:49.910 --> 02:51.590
Bidder No. 303, ¥3,000,000.

18
02:52.030 --> 02:54.750
Bidder No. 250, ¥3,500,000.

19
02:54.800 --> 02:56.710
Bidder No. 303, ¥4,000,000.

20
02:56.950 --> 02:59.300
Bidder No. 250, ¥4,500,000.

21
02:59.810 --> 03:00.760
¥5,000,000.

22
03:02.770 --> 03:04.120
Sorry, sir.

23
03:04.490 --> 03:06.370
This painting is priceless to me.

24
03:06.780 --> 03:08.570
But if you really like it,

25
03:08.730 --> 03:11.260
you can come to my place and admire it anytime.

26
03:11.960 --> 03:12.730
Let's just call it making friends.

27
03:12.730 --> 03:13.540
¥8,000,000.

28
03:16.160 --> 03:16.720
Sir,

29
03:16.740 --> 03:17.530
I'm sorry.

30
03:18.120 --> 03:19.850
You might not know me very well.

31
03:19.960 --> 03:21.170
Anything I love,

32
03:21.590 --> 03:24.790
I don't like to leave it at someone else's place to admire.

33
03:25.120 --> 03:28.180
And I especially don't like it being admired by others.

34
03:30.130 --> 03:30.970
Okay.

35
03:33.140 --> 03:34.740
I'm really sorry, everyone.

36
03:34.990 --> 03:36.720
Due to special circumstances,

37
03:36.980 --> 03:39.310
the collector has suspended the auction.

38
03:39.490 --> 03:40.390
The auction for this item

39
03:40.390 --> 03:41.590
ends here.

40
03:41.610 --> 03:42.340
That's not how it's done.

41
03:42.340 --> 03:43.340
Apologies again.

42
03:44.190 --> 03:45.260
How unruly.

43
03:45.390 --> 03:46.520
The hammer falls, the deal is done.

44
03:46.520 --> 03:48.350
That's the rule of the auction house.

45
03:48.350 --> 03:49.280
What do you mean?

46
03:49.520 --> 03:50.920
I'm really sorry, sir.

47
03:51.470 --> 03:53.550
We are also communicating with the collector.

48
03:53.550 --> 03:54.710
If there's any further news,

49
03:54.710 --> 03:56.510
we will notify you immediately.

50
03:56.720 --> 03:57.530
Sorry.

51
04:04.320 --> 04:05.570
Ning Changyue.

52
04:05.980 --> 04:07.430
You were the one who brought Yu Tu back,

53
04:07.430 --> 04:08.580
but now you don't even care.

54
04:08.580 --> 04:10.640
She's getting mud all over the house.

55
04:16.240 --> 04:17.950
Lift your feet.

56
04:20.160 --> 04:22.360
All you do is watch short dramas all day.

57
04:22.510 --> 04:24.270
I wonder when you'll remember

58
04:24.290 --> 04:25.530
how to break the vow to live forever together.

59
04:25.530 --> 04:27.120
Move your big butt!

60
04:28.740 --> 04:31.160
Since you are the only one, of course I cherish you.

61
04:31.160 --> 04:32.190
Unlike others,

62
04:32.740 --> 04:33.620
you are now…

63
04:40.070 --> 04:41.409
-Give it to me! -No.

64
04:41.950 --> 04:42.680
Give it to me!

65
04:42.730 --> 04:43.330
No!

66
04:45.990 --> 04:47.820
You are now a member of the Censorate,

67
04:47.820 --> 04:49.620
working under the Crown Prince.

68
04:50.260 --> 04:53.060
Osmanthus-themed Painting Special Exhibition.

69
04:54.409 --> 04:56.020
Autumn Art Gallery.

70
04:56.340 --> 04:57.980
I didn't expect anyone to be

71
04:58.000 --> 05:00.130
as obsessed with that painting as I am.

72
05:00.960 --> 05:02.290
I don't know why either.

73
05:02.680 --> 05:03.920
The very first moment I saw that painting,

74
05:03.920 --> 05:06.040
I just really liked it and wanted to own it.

75
05:06.040 --> 05:07.440
Since you like it so much,

76
05:07.480 --> 05:08.880
I want to get it even more.

77
05:13.560 --> 05:16.120
Usually, when people hear someone really likes something,

78
05:16.120 --> 05:17.160
shouldn't they instinctively

79
05:17.160 --> 05:18.950
want to let the other person have it?

80
05:18.950 --> 05:20.070
I'm a businessman.

81
05:20.510 --> 05:21.840
I only care about value.

82
05:22.310 --> 05:23.360
After I get it,

83
05:23.360 --> 05:24.920
you'll buy it at any price,

84
05:25.160 --> 05:26.040
won't you?

85
05:29.520 --> 05:30.790
Nice to meet you.

86
05:31.270 --> 05:32.400
Let's make friends.

87
05:33.970 --> 05:35.030
My name is Lin Huai.

88
05:37.950 --> 05:40.280
You went to this Autumn Art Gallery today?

89
05:40.320 --> 05:41.930
What is an art gallery?

90
05:45.480 --> 05:46.480
Ning Changyue.

91
05:47.430 --> 05:48.290
Ning Changyue.

92
05:48.360 --> 05:49.490
He went out.

93
05:51.000 --> 05:51.760
Went out?

94
05:52.270 --> 05:53.270
Where did he go?

95
05:54.159 --> 05:54.890
I don't know.

96
05:58.570 --> 06:00.270
This is our first time meeting each other.

97
06:00.270 --> 06:01.530
We're not close enough

98
06:01.680 --> 06:03.140
to be considered friends.

99
06:11.160 --> 06:15.000
Sorry, the number you've dialed is temporarily unavailable.

100
06:17.240 --> 06:20.300
Aren't you going to wait for Ning Changyue to come back?

101
06:20.480 --> 06:22.120
Are you going by yourself?

102
06:23.480 --> 06:26.210
What if Ning Changyue makes some progress today?

103
06:27.040 --> 06:27.870
Women

104
06:28.240 --> 06:30.900
have to rely on themselves at critical moments.

105
06:31.430 --> 06:32.220
Hello.

106
06:36.760 --> 06:37.640
Of course.

107
06:37.659 --> 06:39.990
It's an honor for us at Autumn Art Gallery.

108
06:43.190 --> 06:43.720
Okay.

109
06:44.040 --> 06:45.190
I'll go back now.

110
07:02.240 --> 07:03.850
Autumn Art Gallery.

111
07:07.810 --> 07:09.470
Why does it sound so familiar?

112
07:20.190 --> 07:20.830
Sorry.

113
07:21.310 --> 07:22.630
Our gallery is a private gallery

114
07:22.630 --> 07:24.110
that collects works of niche anonymous painters.

115
07:24.110 --> 07:25.640
It's not open to the public.

116
07:28.700 --> 07:29.620
I'm sorry.

117
07:29.690 --> 07:30.490
My apologies.

118
07:51.200 --> 07:53.920
Help me check all the exhibitions about osmanthus trees.

119
07:53.920 --> 07:54.400
Yes.

120
07:54.480 --> 07:56.800
Paintings, calligraphy, vessels, and clothing patterns

121
07:56.800 --> 07:57.780
with osmanthus tree elements.

122
07:57.780 --> 07:58.740
Any kind.

123
08:08.560 --> 08:09.960
I'll call you back later.

124
08:10.230 --> 08:12.600
Did you draw this?

125
08:13.270 --> 08:15.190
Yes. Thank you.

126
08:17.830 --> 08:19.360
Your drawing is beautiful.

127
08:21.740 --> 08:24.800
Many people think it's weird that I like drawing trees.

128
08:25.130 --> 08:26.930
If you like it, it's yours.

129
08:28.080 --> 08:30.860
There was love in your heart when you drew it.

130
08:34.390 --> 08:35.270
Look.

131
08:35.549 --> 08:36.480
All the branches

132
08:36.500 --> 08:39.309
of this tree are desperately growing upward,

133
08:39.600 --> 08:41.030
as if they could touch something

134
08:41.030 --> 08:42.830
as long as they grow high enough.

135
08:42.919 --> 08:44.850
It shows there's an obsession

136
08:44.960 --> 08:46.480
in your heart.

137
08:50.160 --> 08:52.160
Sorry, it's force of habit.

138
08:53.110 --> 08:54.060
My name is Xie He,

139
08:54.190 --> 08:55.260
a clinical psychologist

140
08:55.260 --> 08:56.290
at Hexin Psychological Clinic.

141
08:55.950 --> 08:56.330
[Xie He]

142
09:01.550 --> 09:02.470
Song Yiqiu.

143
09:03.390 --> 09:04.840
Song Yiqiu.

144
09:06.540 --> 09:07.570
Nice to meet you.

145
09:15.620 --> 09:17.750
Why is this guy here again in this life?

146
09:18.730 --> 09:20.260
Song Yiqiu saved him again.

147
09:20.260 --> 09:20.940
Autumn…

148
09:23.420 --> 09:24.030
Autumn…

149
09:24.050 --> 09:25.290
Lingering ghost.

150
09:25.800 --> 09:26.560
Autumn Moon…

151
09:26.880 --> 09:28.240
Lingering ghost.

152
09:28.960 --> 09:30.600
Lingering ghost.

153
09:31.630 --> 09:32.270
Autumn…

154
09:32.870 --> 09:34.080
In this life,

155
09:34.080 --> 09:36.200
I must never let him meet Song Yiqiu.

156
09:37.080 --> 09:37.870
Autumn…

157
09:38.750 --> 09:40.810
-Lingering ghost. -What do you mean?

158
09:48.120 --> 09:49.150
Nothing.

159
09:51.960 --> 09:52.630
Stop.

160
09:53.480 --> 09:54.120
You…

161
09:55.510 --> 09:56.840
Today,

162
09:58.030 --> 09:58.870
where did you go?

163
09:58.870 --> 09:59.670
Me?

164
10:02.080 --> 10:02.870
To an auction.

165
10:02.870 --> 10:04.080
An auction?

166
10:04.510 --> 10:05.910
It was popular hundreds of years ago.

167
10:05.910 --> 10:07.570
Why do you still want to go now?

168
10:07.870 --> 10:09.070
Then what did you buy?

169
10:09.630 --> 10:10.760
-I didn't… -Autumn…

170
10:11.630 --> 10:12.720
I didn't buy anything.

171
10:12.720 --> 10:14.360
I just looked around.

172
10:16.200 --> 10:17.400
You dressed up so nicely.

173
10:17.400 --> 10:18.330
Where did you go?

174
10:23.000 --> 10:24.000
Don't mention it.

175
10:24.480 --> 10:25.670
I got nothing.

176
10:27.960 --> 10:28.840
"Autumn Moon in the Forest."

177
10:28.840 --> 10:29.670
Did you find…

178
10:33.840 --> 10:35.870
"Autumn Moon in the Forest"?

179
10:43.660 --> 10:44.660
Song Yiqiu.

180
10:44.680 --> 10:46.480
Deal with him.

181
10:48.360 --> 10:49.200
"Autumn Moon in the Forest"

182
10:49.200 --> 10:51.730
might be the sacred painting that seals time?

183
10:52.320 --> 10:53.670
Such important news.

184
10:54.120 --> 10:55.440
Why didn't you tell me?

185
10:56.360 --> 10:57.480
Ning Changyue.

186
10:58.030 --> 10:59.790
I'm talking to you.

187
11:01.320 --> 11:02.840
Why didn't you take me with you?

188
11:02.840 --> 11:03.960
It's not that I didn't want to take you with me.

189
11:03.960 --> 11:04.720
I wasn't even sure myself

190
11:04.720 --> 11:06.390
if this was reliable.

191
11:09.670 --> 11:11.670
I think you're just feeling guilty.

192
11:11.670 --> 11:14.030
What, was there someone I shouldn't see?

193
11:22.460 --> 11:23.520
You knew it?

194
11:29.030 --> 11:31.840
Was it your Miss Liu or Miss Wang?

195
11:31.910 --> 11:33.440
But don't worry.

196
11:33.440 --> 11:34.790
I know everything.

197
11:34.790 --> 11:36.030
I don't care.

198
11:36.030 --> 11:37.830
You don't have to hide it from me.

199
11:38.390 --> 11:39.000
Yeah.

200
11:39.320 --> 11:42.870
The auction. The antique shop. The top ten beauties were all there.

201
11:42.870 --> 11:44.150
Of course I couldn't let you go.

202
11:44.150 --> 11:46.360
And in the end, that painting went unsold.

203
11:46.360 --> 11:47.960
The scroll was only half unrolled.

204
11:47.960 --> 11:50.420
It would have been a waste of time if you went.

205
11:50.770 --> 11:53.050
Could it be because you

206
11:53.670 --> 11:55.320
have too much bad luck?

207
11:55.670 --> 11:57.310
If it were me,

208
11:57.390 --> 11:59.240
since I have better luck than you,

209
11:59.240 --> 12:01.240
I definitely would have won the bid.

210
12:02.120 --> 12:03.320
If you had gone,

211
12:03.790 --> 12:05.510
someone else would have had the good luck.

212
12:05.510 --> 12:06.550
What did you say?

213
12:06.910 --> 12:09.320
I'm talking to you, Ning Changyue!

214
12:09.720 --> 12:11.050
Alright, stop talking.

215
12:11.200 --> 12:12.330
Let me think about it

216
12:12.910 --> 12:15.440
and try to reconstruct it for you from memory.

217
12:15.440 --> 12:17.750
We weren't allowed to take photos of the auction items.

218
12:17.750 --> 12:18.630
I only took one look,

219
12:18.630 --> 12:21.430
so I might not be able to reconstruct it perfectly.

220
12:25.440 --> 12:26.900
Prepare the brush and ink.

221
12:28.720 --> 12:29.840
Me?

222
12:29.870 --> 12:30.960
Who else?

223
12:31.960 --> 12:33.360
Didn't you want to see the painting?

224
12:33.360 --> 12:34.150
You haven't seen it,

225
12:34.150 --> 12:35.550
so you can only rely on me.

226
12:37.360 --> 12:38.600
Alright.

227
12:38.870 --> 12:39.840
Brush.

228
12:47.150 --> 12:47.790
Ink.

229
12:58.440 --> 12:59.720
Be serious.

230
12:59.720 --> 13:01.060
This is delicate work.

231
13:01.090 --> 13:02.470
Even a slight mistake will prevent you

232
13:02.470 --> 13:05.020
from reproducing the elegance of "Autumn Moon in the Forest."

233
13:05.020 --> 13:06.660
Are you going to draw or not?

234
13:31.000 --> 13:32.440
Mountains.

235
13:34.040 --> 13:35.160
A full moon.

236
13:39.120 --> 13:40.240
What else?

237
13:49.000 --> 13:50.400
Why did you stop drawing?

238
13:52.590 --> 13:53.960
This tree crown…

239
13:54.720 --> 13:56.580
I don't really know how to draw it.

240
13:59.600 --> 14:00.790
Then do you still remember

241
14:00.790 --> 14:02.590
what this tree crown looks like?

242
14:04.830 --> 14:06.370
It has quite thick foliage.

243
14:06.630 --> 14:09.290
And the branches stretch out in all directions,

244
14:09.320 --> 14:12.420
forming a huge umbrella shape.

245
14:15.440 --> 14:18.240
Didn't I teach you during the Southern Qin period?

246
15:00.650 --> 15:01.640
Focus.

247
15:23.790 --> 15:26.270
You can't even draw such a simple tree crown?

248
15:52.200 --> 15:53.920
This tree crown…

249
15:54.550 --> 15:55.390
This tree crown

250
15:55.390 --> 15:56.790
is very tree crown-like.

251
15:58.030 --> 15:59.750
I'll go call Yu Tu over here.

252
16:01.750 --> 16:02.870
She should know

253
16:03.280 --> 16:04.680
about the tree, right?

254
16:35.000 --> 16:37.400
What do you mean by "very tree crown-like"?

255
16:47.440 --> 16:49.700
What are you thinking about, Song Yiqiu?

256
16:51.080 --> 16:52.510
You two are no longer

257
16:52.510 --> 16:55.510
the Song Yiqiu and Ning Changyue from 3,000 years ago.

258
16:56.480 --> 16:57.440
Did you forget?

259
17:04.160 --> 17:05.349
It's so late.

260
17:06.109 --> 17:06.930
Who is it?

261
17:18.920 --> 17:20.069
You're…

262
17:20.069 --> 17:23.200
Is this Mr. Ning's house?

263
17:25.160 --> 17:26.089
No.

264
17:31.400 --> 17:32.720
I got the wrong place?

265
17:34.590 --> 17:35.640
No.

266
17:36.070 --> 17:37.640
But he's a tenant,

267
17:38.230 --> 17:39.510
and I'm the landlord.

268
17:45.750 --> 17:46.680
Have some water.

269
17:47.640 --> 17:48.550
Thank you.

270
17:52.270 --> 17:55.000
I didn't expect someone as successful as Mr. Ning

271
17:55.160 --> 17:56.200
to still be…

272
17:56.880 --> 18:00.140
-Fifteen. Fifteen. Fifteen. -Fifteen. Fifteen. Twenty.

273
18:00.550 --> 18:02.150
Sharing a place with others.

274
18:14.680 --> 18:16.940
Save when you can, spend when you should.

275
18:17.120 --> 18:18.820
Manager Qing Yuan, you came to see me so late.

276
18:18.820 --> 18:20.220
Is something the matter?

277
18:20.720 --> 18:22.880
I came here specifically to apologize.

278
18:22.880 --> 18:25.890
Today, the owner canceled the auction halfway through,

279
18:25.890 --> 18:28.310
so you couldn't win the bid on "Autumn Moon in the Forest."

280
18:28.310 --> 18:29.240
I'm sorry.

281
18:29.880 --> 18:32.990
Now, this painting is in the Autumn Art Gallery.

282
18:33.200 --> 18:34.160
Please look.

283
18:35.110 --> 18:36.590
Autumn Art Gallery?

284
18:40.920 --> 18:42.480
Can we go?

285
18:45.750 --> 18:46.720
I'm sorry.

286
18:46.830 --> 18:49.480
Autumn Art Gallery is a private collection museum

287
18:49.480 --> 18:51.350
that is only open to VIP members.

288
19:02.560 --> 19:04.590
[Autumn Art Gallery]
